# Cloudflare Pages _redirects — gstcalculator.me
# Enforces trailing slash on all URLs

# Blog posts
/blog/:slug  /blog/:slug/  301

# Top-level pages
/blog     /blog/     301
/privacy  /privacy/  301
/about    /about/    301
/contact  /contact/  301

# SPA fallback — any unmatched path renders the React app's NotFound page,
# with the HTTP status forced to 404 so it isn't indexed as a real page.
/*  /index.html  404
